 'Transfer: due care is taking reasonable protective action; due diligence includes investigation and ongoing assessment. They can overlap—do not treat “audit” as an automatic keyword. A control implementation describes protection; a pre-acquisition investigation describes evaluation. Residual risk remains after controls. Data stewards focus on quality/governance; custodians operate protection mechanisms.',
