q(T,'diligence-transfer','Before selecting a provider, a team investigates its security practices, checks evidence and assesses its risks. Which concept best captures this investigation?', [('Due diligence','Investigation and assessment support an informed decision.'),('Risk avoidance automatically','No decision to abandon the activity has yet been made.'),('Non-repudiation','Concerns accountability for actions, not vendor investigation.'),('Data masking','Conceals display values, not due investigation.')], 'Investigation before commitment.','transfer')
